    <name>
      <text>Calculation and Limits of a Given Function</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p></p>
<p>Note 1: If any part of this question has no solution please simply answer <code>NO</code>. Otherwise, give your answers correct to 3 significant figures.</p>
<p> Note 2: Please remember to use radians, not degrees.</p>
<p></p>
<p>1. If \(\displaystyle f(x) = {@fx@}\), evaluate \(f({@0@})\) = [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p></p>
<p>2. Fill in the table below.</p><table>
