<p><br></p><p>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;\( \displaystyle \lim_{x\rightarrow 0} f(x) = \)&nbsp;[[input:ans8]]&nbsp; [[validation:ans8]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt8]]</p>]]></text>
